# Introduction to Teamwork (sandoria 63) with its era module (quest rework B3b, Task 9): five of main's nation in a
# party of six. The module (xi.pre(xi.expansion.ROV): RESTRICT_CONTENT 1, ENABLE_ROV 0) needs six of the nation
# (same-nation count >= 6); fay is Bastok (nation 1): #party 6 passes, the count is 5, updateEvent(3, 1) (the quest's
# own: 15, 1); finish option 0 with the local Prog 0: nothing.
module modules/era/lua/quests/sandoria/introduction_to_teamwork.lua
lists WestRonfaure/Vilatroire/onTrigger WestRonfaure/onEventUpdate/129 WestRonfaure/onEventFinish/129
char zone=WestRonfaure pos=-258.861,-70.999,423.42 job=WAR lvl=10 nation=0
char bob zone=WestRonfaure pos=-258.861,-70.999,428 job=WAR lvl=10 nation=0
char carl zone=WestRonfaure pos=-256,-70.999,426 job=WAR lvl=10 nation=0
char dave zone=WestRonfaure pos=-256,-70.999,421 job=WAR lvl=10 nation=0
char eve zone=WestRonfaure pos=-261.5,-70.999,426 job=WAR lvl=10 nation=0
char fay zone=WestRonfaure pos=-261.5,-70.999,421 job=WAR lvl=10 nation=1
setting RESTRICT_CONTENT 1
setting ENABLE_ROV 0
quest Sandoria.IntroductionToTeamwork accepted
login
bob: login
carl: login
dave: login
eve: login
fay: login
invite bob
bob: accept
invite carl
carl: accept
invite dave
dave: accept
invite eve
eve: accept
invite fay
fay: accept                               # six: five San d'Oria, fay Bastok
trigger Vilatroire                        # 129 { [1] = 1 }
update 129 option=0                       # #party 6; five of the nation (below 6): updateEvent(3, 1)
finish                                    # option 0, the local Prog 0: nothing
